                "description": "With its sleek style and modern look, the Modern Brass Stuttgart Lever with Square Rose is a great choice for contemporary homes. Choose from several modern finishes including satin nickel, polished chrome, and oil rubbed bronze. The Stuttgart Leverset is available in dummy, passage, and privacy functions. It will fit 1-1/4 inch to 3 inch thick doors and has an optional 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset.\r\n",
